{"author":{"id":"609bf866d4a5d716c19faf5d617b3bf3de478230d29602d72aad5aa90a80466f"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790512791,"nonce":"WLvI5VX0QnbVH17DnPy4am4qdnI=","title":"ASH_GC_STRESS never collects in AOT (native and wasm)","message":"Since 9aac8f3 the AOT `main` registers the constants blob with\n`hlp_gc_add_scan_root`. That goes through `ImmixAllocator::add_scan_range`,\nthe interpreter's root-snapshot API, which sets `heap.safepoint_mode = true`.\nFrom then on `maybe_collect` defers every due collection (`collect_pending`)\nuntil pressure passes the hard bound, and a deferred collection runs only at\na safepoint. In AOT the only one is `tlab_refill_then_alloc` -\u003e\n`maybe_collect_at_safepoint`. `ASH_GC_STRESS` disables the TLAB, so under\nstress an AOT program never collects at all.\n\nMeasured, 2M string allocations (214 MB), native AOT on the Mac:\n\n    default            27 collections\n    ASH_GC_STRESS=1     0 collections\n    ASH_GC_TLAB=0       0 collections\n    interp + stress    55 collections (deferred to snapshots, by design)\n\nlldb on the binary: allocate_kind reaches the due branch (registered=1,\nstress=1), then `[heap+0x1d4]` (safepoint_mode) is 1 and it takes the defer\npath; add_scan_range is first called from main+24.\n\nConsequences: every AOT/wasm \"passes under ASH_GC_STRESS\" result since\n2026-09-01 exercised no collection. On wasm this hides a real hazard class:\na collection at a TLAB refill runs inside whatever ash_std function asked for\nmemory, and the wasm scan sees only the shadow stack, so a pointer that\nfunction holds only in a wasm local across a second allocation is not a\nroot. Reported by the caribou session (caribou git-bug e964da6): on its heap,\nwith stress collecting at every allocation, test_basic.hl built for\nwasm32-wasip1 fails at startup with \"Can't cast  to \u003cgarbage\u003e\" in\nType.initClass.\n\nFix direction: a static data range (the constants blob) should not set\nsafepoint_mode; give it its own registration, separate from the\ninterpreter's snapshot ranges. Then run the wasm corpus under real stress.","files":null}]}